WEBVTT

NOTE Editable captions. Shot timing comes from synthetic speech transcription and edit-decisions.json.

c01-0
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.900
We have a deal.

c01-1
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.000
Meet Rho, your first mate.

c02-0
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.020
I'm Rho, your first mate.

c02-1
00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:19.280
I'll help you learn about Maya and Fortuna, and
guide you along the way.

c03-sound
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.500
[Footsteps]

c04-0
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:25.720
Crew ready.

c04-1
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.340
The path is clear.

c05-sound
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:31.500
[Plane engines rev; wheels roll]

c06-sound
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.500
[Propellers and wind]

c07-0
00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:45.440
That storm is moving fast.

c07-1
00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:47.960
Turn back!

c08-sound
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:52.500
[Thunder; engine falters]

c09-0
00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.080
The engine's on fire!

c09-1
00:00:57.800 --> 00:00:58.840
We're losing power!

c10-0
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.620
Crew, get ready!

c10-1
00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:05.580
Captain, pull the blue handle!

c11-sound
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:12.500
[Wind; parachutes flutter]

c12-sound
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:19.500
[Splash; surf]

c13-0
00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:25.040
Captain.

c13-1
00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:28.000
Are you all right?

c14-0
00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:31.480
The crew is scattered.

c14-1
00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:33.740
We can't reach the base.

c14-2
00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:36.260
You're still the captain.

c14-3
00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:38.940
Find the crew.

c14-4
00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:39.960
Build a camp.

c14-5
00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:41.420
We'll rebuild the ship.

c14-6
00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:43.580
I'll help you learn to lead.

c15-0
00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:50.540
One day, you could lead a space empire.

c15-1
00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:53.200
First, let's get your crew home.

c16-0
00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:57.560
Start with the wreck.

c16-1
00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:00.220
What food and tools can we save?

